    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA characterful residence set on a picturesque residential road conveniently located within a stone's throw to all amenities. \n\nIn need of complete refurbishment throughout, this well-located property offers a blank canvas for the discerning purchaser. With the added benefit of qualifying for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant (subject to eligibility), the property offers excellent scope to create a home of real character and value in a most convenient location.\n\nThe property offers excellent frontage along Mountain View Road with large front garden with off-street parking and a private rear garden with pedestrian gate onto Mountain View Road. There is possibility to further extend subject to the relevant planning permission. \n\nThe convenience of this location cannot be overstated, situated minutes from Killiney Beach and DART station and close to an array of local shops and amenities. A short drive away is Dalkey with its extensive choice of pubs, restaurants and shops. There is also a local bus service which runs to Dun Laoghaire and the Luas & M50 are easily accessible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Gas fired central heating </li><li>Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant </li><li>Private car parking </li><li>Bus stop in the immediate vicinity </li><li>Luas at Cherrywood </li><li>Short walk to Killiney Dart </li><li>Short walk to Killiney Beach </li><li>Access on foot to shops, pharmacy and post office</ul>"
      },
